// Title: Service Startup Type Change Via Wmic.EXE
// ID: c0514f28-fdae-42df-b886-06e2b2bc5b37
// Status: experimental
// Level: medium
// Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2026-04-27
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1047, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects changes to service startup type to 'disabled' or 'manual' using the WMIC command-line utility.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " service ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "ChangeStartMode")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Manual") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Disabled"))) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\WMIC.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "wmic.exe"))))
